<title>USA: Cytel gets $1.5 mln milestone payment.</title>
<headline>Cytel gets $1.5 mln milestone payment.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cytel Corp said Friday it had reached a milestone in its collaboration with Abbott Laboratories Inc, triggering a $1.5 million payment to Cytel by Abbott.</p>
<p>Cytel said it and Abbott are collaborating to develop manufacturing processes for the production of carbohydrates that will be used in Abbott's nutritional products.</p>
<p>According to Cytel, the milestone payment recognizes the transfer of technology from Cytel to Abbott, enabling the manufacture of a carbohydrate to be used by the Ross Products Division of Abbott.</p>
